# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("Binding groups and cycles": the order of a group's lines decides positions and nothing else), ch. 8 (a widget application is transparent) and ruling TC (places counted as built): the button is 0, the counter's label 1, the loud arm's label 2; each click adds the arm's result and one.
test loud

